   "title": "Rzeka, four days live in Studio A",
   "category": "sessions",
   "image": "drums.jpg",
   "excerpt": "Six players in the room, no click, three Coles ribbons on the kit. The album is out in spring.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Rzeka tracked their third album live, all six of them in the room at once, with the singer in booth 2. Bartek miked the kit with a pair of Coles 4038s and a Tonsil MD 263 on the kick, which nobody believed would work.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>Room</td><td>Studio A</td></tr><tr><td>Days</td><td>4 tracking, 3 mixing in Studio B</td></tr><tr><td>Engineer</td><td>Marta Kołodziej</td></tr><tr><td>Tape</td><td>Two reels on the Studer, then Pro Tools</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":2,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/images/drums.jpg' ) ); ?>\" alt=\"Photo from the session: Rzeka, four days live in Studio A\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">On the day</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/images/console.jpg' ) ); ?>\" alt=\"The Studio A control room\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">In the control room</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">We booked four days and finished in three. We used the fourth to play pool.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>From the band, afterwards</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Gdańsk Chamber Choir, Christmas record",
   "category": "sessions",
   "image": "vocal.jpg",
   "excerpt": "Thirty-two singers, one pair of U 87s and the plate reverb next door.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Thirty-two singers stood in a horseshoe in the live room. We used a spaced pair of U 87s and almost nothing else, and sent a little to the EMT plate in the old paint store.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>Room</td><td>Studio A</td></tr><tr><td>Days</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Engineer</td><td>Bartek Szulc</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":2,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/images/vocal.jpg' ) ); ?>\" alt=\"Photo from the session: Gdańsk Chamber Choir, Christmas record\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">On the day</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/images/console.jpg' ) ); ?>\" alt=\"The Studio A control room\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">In the control room</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">We booked four days and finished in three. We used the fourth to play pool.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>From the band, afterwards</cite></blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->"
