  {
   "title": "New tape machine, same old tape",
   "category": "news",
   "image": "tape.jpg",
   "excerpt": "The Studer is back from service with new heads. Tape prices went up again.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">The Studer A827 is back from two months at the service shop in Łódź, with new heads and a lot of cleaning. A reel of 2 inch tape now costs 1,150 zł, so most bands record to tape for the basic tracks and then move to Pro Tools. You are welcome to bring your own reels.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>Turnaround</td><td>We need a week to align it for a new tape formula</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Rehearsal room open on Sundays",
   "category": "news",
   "image": "amp.jpg",
   "excerpt": "From October the rehearsal room opens Sundays 12:00 to 22:00.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">From October the rehearsal room is open on Sundays too, 12:00 to 22:00. Book by text with Iga. Three hours minimum at weekends.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>Price</td><td>60 zł an hour</td></tr><tr><td>Book</td><td>+48 600 555 219, by text</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->"
  },
  {
   "title": "Ola Kruk, a solo drum record in one day",
   "category": "sessions",
   "image": "tape.jpg",
   "excerpt": "Twelve improvisations on the house kit, straight to half-inch tape, no edits.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Ola booked the \"one song in a day\" package and recorded twelve instead. Everything went straight to the Otari at 15 ips, no edits and no overdubs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"is-style-defs\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-style-defs\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Room</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Studio A</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Days</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">1</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Engineer</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Bartek Szulc</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">Tape</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p class=\"\">One reel of half-inch</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":2,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/images/tape.jpg' ) ); ?>\" alt=\"A reel-to-reel tape deck in the dark\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The Otari</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":true}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"<?php echo esc_url( get_theme_file_uri( 'assets/images/drums.jpg' ) ); ?>\" alt=\"A drum kit from above\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The house kit</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->"
